WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
But they said, you know what their excuse is?

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.480
Yeah, but it was a long weekend.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.000
In other words, it was a long weekend, so that was okay.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.240
And then Pritzker gets up and he says like,

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.680
I don't know what they're talking about.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.040
We don't have crime here.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.120
They're crazy.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.780
I think actually they're petrified.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.020
You know, their families live there, everything else.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.200
I actually think they're scared.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.860
Pritzker was a failure in his family.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.600
They threw him out of the family business.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.760
Guy's a loser.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:25.600
But you know what?

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.400
They actually, I believe they're scared.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.840
They're actually frightened for their lives.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.439
Jack, please say a few words.

